WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
---

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
Devil fruits: The utlimate power system in One&nbsp;
Piece. And today we’re going to talk about every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.360
single devil fruit that has officially appeared&nbsp;
in the series so far based on the mangahb.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.620
Starting with all Zoan type devil fruits.&nbsp;
This category of fruits allows the user to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.860
transform into an animal, granting&nbsp;
them immense strength and stamina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:20.608
and depending on the fruit some&nbsp;
unique bonus abilities as well.

00:00:20.608 --> 00:00:20.621
**Ushi Ushi**

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:22.380
1. **Bison Dalton**
And at number one, we have a pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.720
straight forward transformation. Dalton, the King&nbsp;
of the Sakura Kingdom uses his Ushi Ushi no Mi:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.540
Model Bison to turn into a Bison.
2. **Giraffe Kaku**

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:35.100
Kaku of CP9 on the other hand uses his&nbsp;
fruit to turn into a giraffe. You’d&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.880
think this would be a useless power, but&nbsp;
using his long neck as a counter balance,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.320
he actually uses this transformation to&nbsp;
enhance his swordsmanship. Not sure why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:48.540
it’s categorized as a cow fruit though. But as&nbsp;
you’ll see, a few fruits don’t really make sense.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.122
**Hito Hito**

00:00:49.122 --> 00:00:51.600
1. **Human Chopper
What’s better than being a cow? Turning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.460
into a human being.** Chopper is a reindeer&nbsp;
who ate the Hito-Hito no Mi, the human human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.460 --> 00:01:02.940
fruit. Presumably this fruit would be absolutely&nbsp;
useless if a human ate it (or if the SBS is to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:08.460
be believed, they might gain enlightenment), but&nbsp;
in Chopper’s case he gained the ability to walk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.310
talk, and have a human intellect.
2. **Buddha Sengoku**

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:15.780
The former Fleet Admiral of the Marines,&nbsp;
Sengoku, uses the Daibutsu fruit to transform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:21.090
into a giant Golden Buddha, making for a very&nbsp;
intimidating presence on the battlefield.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:21.810
1. **Onyudo Onimaru**

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:26.700
Sticking with Japanese Mythology, Onimaru is a&nbsp;
komagitsune - a type of mythical fox. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:32.790
this is unrelated to his devil fruit. The Onyudo&nbsp;
fruit allows Onimaru to transform into an Onyudo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:38.700
- a type of giant monk yokai. Like Chopper,&nbsp;
this fruit grants Onimaru the ability to speak.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:39.060
1. **Nika Luffy**

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:43.140
Well, what do you know? We’re only 6&nbsp;
fruits in and we’ve already gotten to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:47.280
our main character. For years Oda lead&nbsp;
to us to believe that Luffy had the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:52.680
Gomu Gomu no Mi. In reality, though, his&nbsp;
fruit was actually the Hito Hito no Mi:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:53.866
Model Nika. Mythical Zoan fruits like this&nbsp;
allow the user to turn into a mythological&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:54.660
creature and these imbue some of the greatest&nbsp;
powers in all of One Piece. This fruit for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:00.060
example grants Luffy the powers of the Sun God&nbsp;
NIka, nicknamed the “Toon Force” by the fandom,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:06.060
which are seemingly only&nbsp;
limited by his imagination.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:11.940
And the most powerful human type devil fruit of&nbsp;
all is of course the subscriber subscriber no mi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.529
eaten by you, after destroy the&nbsp;
subscribe button below this video.

00:02:16.529 --> 00:02:16.542
**Tori Tori**

00:02:16.542 --> 00:02:18.900
1. **Falcon Pell**
Next we have the birds. Pell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:24.000
one of Princess Vivi’s guardians in Alabasta&nbsp;
can transform into a falcon, allowing for super&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:29.040
fast flight. His hybrid form makes Pell looks&nbsp;
like Horus, the falcon-headed god of Egyptian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.720
mythology. The jury’s still out on whether&nbsp;
falcons can withstand nuclear weapons, though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.020
like Pell did at the end of the arc.
2. **Phoenix Marco**&nbsp;

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:42.540
One of the coolest fruits in the entire series is&nbsp;
Marco’s Phoenix fruit. Whitebeard’s first division&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:48.480
commander, Marco, is also the doctor of the crew,&nbsp;
which works out because the Phoenix fruit’s flames&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:52.140
allow him to heal himself and others.
3. **Albatross Morgans**&nbsp;

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.180
For some reason, Big News Morgans, who&nbsp;
always keeps in his hybrid albatross form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:02.580
cannot fly. Ironic, given that real world&nbsp;
albatrosses are known for their extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:07.818
long flights across the sea. Good thing he has&nbsp;
those news coos to deliver the papers for him.

00:03:07.818 --> 00:03:07.829
**Inu Inu**

00:03:07.829 --> 00:03:07.860
10 **Dachshund Lasso (Cannon)**

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:13.680
Moving on to men’s best friend and all the&nbsp;
doggos. Starting with Lasso of Baroque Works,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:20.520
who is not a dog who ate a cannon fruit. He’s&nbsp;
actually a cannon who was fed the Inu Inu no Mi:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.460
Model Dachshund. This character was the very first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:28.541
instance of learning that inanimate&nbsp;
objects could be fed devil fruits.

00:03:28.541 --> 00:03:28.560
1. **Jackal Chaka**

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.820
Chaka is the other zoan guardian&nbsp;
of Alabasta. His hybrid form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:36.943
makes him look like the Egyptian God&nbsp;
Anubis, who has a jackal for a head.

00:03:36.943 --> 00:03:36.960
1. **Wolf Jabra**

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:42.720
Jabra of CP9 uses his devil fruit to&nbsp;
transform into a powerful wolf. In addition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:48.000
he loves using trickery and storytelling to try&nbsp;
and fool his victims, calling upon the many fairy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:53.010
tales which feature a “Big Bad Wolf” such as&nbsp;
the Three Little Pigs or Little Red Riding Hood.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.000
1. **Tanuki Bunbuku (teapot)**

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:59.820
Another inanimate object with a devil fruit,&nbsp;
Bunbuku is a teapot who ate a Tanuki fruit.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:03:59.940
1. **Kitsune Catarina Devon**

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:04.860
Catarina Devon is one of Blackbeard’s&nbsp;
crewmates. With her Kitsune mythical zoan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:09.060
she can transform her appearance&nbsp;
to appear as someone else.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.220
1. **Makami Yamato**

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:16.320
Yamato, Kaidou’s son, has a mythical zoan&nbsp;
that transforms him into the Okuchi no Makami,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:20.367
a protector of Wano who&nbsp;
possesses ice-based powers.

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:20.380
**Neko Neko**

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:20.400
1. **Leopard Lucci**

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:27.540
And after dogs come of course&nbsp;
cats. Lucci, the powerhouse of CP9,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:32.220
uses his leopard transformation to gain&nbsp;
immense strength, dexterity, and agility.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.480
1. **Saber-Toothed Tiger Who's who**

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:38.400
Who’s Who, the former member of CP9, fits right&nbsp;
in with the beast Pirates with his Saber-Toothed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:43.884
Tiger zoan. Like many of his crewmates, his&nbsp;
ancient devil fruit is based on an extinct animal.

00:04:43.884 --> 00:04:43.895
**Zou Zou**

00:04:43.895 --> 00:04:43.920
1. **Elephant Funkfreed**

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:47.760
Which brings us over to 2 elephant&nbsp;
fruits. Yet another inanimate object&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:52.020
with a devil fruit power, Funkfreed&nbsp;
is a sword who can transform into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.601
an extremely cute elephant. I&nbsp;
mean, just look at those eyes.

00:04:55.601 --> 00:04:55.620
1. **Mammoth Jack**

00:04:55.620 --> 00:05:00.000
And on the opposite side of&nbsp;
the cuteness spectrum is Jack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.740
one of Kaidou’s All Stars, is a&nbsp;
fishman who ate a Mammoth devil fruit.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.457
**Ryu Ryu**

00:05:05.457 --> 00:05:06.060
1. **Allosaurus X-Drake**

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:12.420
For some people this next one is definitely the&nbsp;
best category of animal to turn into: Dinosaurs.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.260
Don’t get it twisted - Diez-Drake is&nbsp;
not a T-Rex. He’s an allosaurus. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:20.820
according to paleontologists those are two&nbsp;
different dinosaurs. Interestingly enough,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.460
like all of the other dinosaur fruits to come on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:28.617
this list - the fruit name is “Ryu Ryu”&nbsp;
which means “Dragon”, not “Dinosaur.”

00:05:28.617 --> 00:05:30.047
1. **Spinosaurus Page One**

00:05:30.047 --> 00:05:33.060
Page One’s Spinosaurus fruit is&nbsp;
yet another powerful dinosaur&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.400
transformation from one of the Tobi Roppo.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.780
1. **Pteranodon King**

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:41.160
The All-Star King’s Pteranodon fruit is modeled&nbsp;
after a flying dinosaur significantly larger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:45.720
than the pterodactyl. The most significant&nbsp;
power King’s fruit gives him is flight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:50.520
however, Oda’s mastery of biology teaches us&nbsp;
that they are also able to use their large&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:54.840
crests and beaks in a sling-shot&nbsp;
effect to utilize ranged attacks.

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.460
1. **Brachiosaurus Queen**

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:02.040
Queen, the last of Kaidou’s All-Stars we’re&nbsp;
covering, has a Brachiosaurus fruit. And yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:07.380
again, we get a science lesson from Oda that&nbsp;
states that Brachiosauruses can launch their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:12.900
long neck and tail from the rest of their&nbsp;
body to become a snake-like creature. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:17.400
manga makes this very clear that this is not&nbsp;
one of Queen’s many cybernetic enhancements,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.430
but a natural born ability of all Brachiosauruses.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:21.120
1. **Pachycephalosaurus Ulti**

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:28.440
Ulti, one of the Tobiroppo, has a very&nbsp;
fitting dinosaur zoan transformation. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:34.080
Pachycephalosaurus literally means “thick-headed&nbsp;
lizard”, boasting a skull several times thicker&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:39.120
than any other dinosaur. Makes sense for the&nbsp;
most stubborn and “hard-headed” of Kaidou’s crew.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:39.720
1. **Triceratops Sasaki**

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.400
The last of our Ryu Ryu no Mi fruits is&nbsp;
Sasaki’s Model Triceratops. ****During&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:48.660
Franky’s fight against this Tobi Roppo member,&nbsp;
we get yet another paleontology lesson when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:54.420
we learn that Triceratops’ frill can spin&nbsp;
around like a propeller enabling it to fly.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:55.260
**Hebi Hebi**

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.971
Also reptiles, and also quite terrifying,&nbsp;
we have the snake devil fruits.

00:06:58.971 --> 00:06:59.280
1. **King Cobra Marigold**
Onto the Hebi Hebi no Mi, or snake models, we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:01.320
have Marigold’s King Cobra fruit.
2. **Anaconda Sandersonia**&nbsp;

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:06.120
As well as Sandersonia’s anaconda fruit.&nbsp;
Both of these Boa sisters have snake&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:12.040
transformations - fitting for siblings based on&nbsp;
the famous Gorgon sisters of Greek Mythology.&nbsp;

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.160
3. **Orochi Orochi**
And yet another Hebi Hebi no Mi model from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:20.880
Mythology is the Orochi fruit held by…Orochi. This&nbsp;
member of the Kurozumi clan really lucked out on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:26.580
finding a fruit that shared his literal name. It&nbsp;
allows him to transform into the 8 headed snake,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:31.320
the Yamato no Orochi. Its bonus effect is&nbsp;
that all of his heads have to be removed for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:38.520
him to be killed, which lead to not one but&nbsp;
9 satisfying decapitations in the Wano arc.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:38.867
**Sara Sara**

00:07:38.867 --> 00:07:40.260
1. **Axolotl Smiley**
Smiley was a weaponized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:43.800
gas cloud given life in the form of&nbsp;
an Axolotl. Upon its destruction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:49.589
we learned that a devil fruit reincarnates into&nbsp;
another normal fruit nearby upon its user’s death.

00:07:49.589 --> 00:07:49.604
**Mushi Mushi**

00:07:49.604 --> 00:07:50.700
1. **Beetle Kabu
And interestingly enough,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:55.800
there are only 3 insect devil fruits in&nbsp;
one piece.** Mushi is Japanese for Bug&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:00.720
and these two mushi mushi no mis are owned by&nbsp;
warriors of the Tontatta. First off is Kabu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.560
with the Beetle fruit.
2. **Hornet Bian**

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.780
And then Bian with the Hornet fruit.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:04.242
**Uo Uo**

00:08:04.242 --> 00:08:07.200
1. **Seiryu Kaidou
And** Ironically, Kaidou’s actual&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:14.520
dragon fruit is not a Ryu Ryu fruit, but an Uo Uo&nbsp;
fruit: a fish fruit. His fruit is derived from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:20.100
Japanese myth of a carp jumping over a waterfall&nbsp;
to transform into a dragon (Think the Magikarp to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:25.800
Gyarados transformation from Pokemon). Seiryu, or&nbsp;
the Azure Dragon, is also one of the four sacred&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:31.394
beasts of Chinese Astrology (joined by the White&nbsp;
Tiger, the Red Phoenix, and the Black Tortoise).

00:08:31.394 --> 00:08:31.407
**Kumo Kumo**

00:08:31.407 --> 00:08:33.780
1. **Rosamygale Grauvogeli Black Maria
The 3rd insect fruit.** Black Maria&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:38.880
seems to have more in common with a Black Widow&nbsp;
spider than the Rosamygale Grauvogeli, However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:43.200
the Rosamygale Grauvogeli is an ancient,&nbsp;
extinct spider, which makes this fruit fit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.930
in a lot better with the other ancient&nbsp;
extinct creatures of the beast pirates.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:46.953
**Single Model Series**

00:08:46.953 --> 00:08:48.720
1. **Mole Miss Merry Xmas**
The rest of our Zoan fruits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:54.240
are single model fruits that only have a single&nbsp;
member or the actual fruit names are unknown.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:59.441
Starting off the list is Miss Merry Christmas&nbsp;
of Baroque Works who can transform into a mole.&nbsp;

00:08:59.441 --> 00:09:01.440
2. **Horse Pierre**
Then we have Pierre, a large pink&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:07.728
bird who ate a horse fruit. This enables Pierre&nbsp;
to transform into an approximation of a Pegasus.&nbsp;

00:09:07.728 --> 00:09:09.840
3. **Turtle Pekoms**
Pekoms is a lion mink who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.120
transform into a turtle. Shell yeah.
4. **Egg Tamago**

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.060
Baron Tamago has one of the&nbsp;
more interesting zoan devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:21.240
fruits. He begins as an egg man…not like Dr.&nbsp;
Robotnik…just a man in an egg shell. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:25.544
he can transform into a fully developed&nbsp;
egg and become a full-blown chicken.

00:09:25.544 --> 00:09:27.540
1. **Minotaur**
The Impel Down jailers all have what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:32.880
are referred to as “awakened zoans” - they lose&nbsp;
their higher functions and turn into simple-minded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:38.563
rampaging beasts with immense strength. They are&nbsp;
a minotaur - presumably with a bull devil fruit.&nbsp;

00:09:38.563 --> 00:09:39.643
2. **Minokoala**
A koala.&nbsp;

00:09:39.643 --> 00:09:40.603
3. **Minorhino**
A rhino.&nbsp;

00:09:40.603 --> 00:09:44.400
4. **Minozebra**
And a zebra. These four are contenders for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:51.060
first “awakened” fruits we ever saw in the series,&nbsp;
unless we count Chopper’s monster point, which is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.700
currently unconfirmed as a devil fruit awakening.
5. **Spider *unknown* Onigumo&nbsp;

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:59.880
Did i say 3 insects? Well i lied, there are two&nbsp;
more.** Vice Admiral Onigumo of the Marines has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:05.700
an unknown devil fruit that allows him to grow&nbsp;
several spider-like arms. His name is also the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.696
Japanese name of a variety of spider.
6. **Dalmatian Dalmation**

00:10:08.696 --> 00:10:12.120
And Vice Admiral Dalmatian also&nbsp;
has a very on-the-nose name,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:16.595
as his currently unnamed devil fruit&nbsp;
allow him to transform into a Dalmatian.

00:10:16.595 --> 00:10:16.620
1. **Caterpillar Epoida**

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:22.020
And the last insect, Also appearing in the&nbsp;
Summit War is Epoida, an ally of Whitebeard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:26.220
who can transform into a Caterpillar&nbsp;
with his unnamed zoan devil fruit.

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:26.760
1. **Minochihuahua Chihuahua**

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:30.600
In a cover story detailing what happened&nbsp;
in Impel Down after the prison break,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:34.957
we meet the newest jailer -&nbsp;
an adorable Minochihuahua.

00:10:34.957 --> 00:10:34.980
1. **Pegasus Stronger**

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:41.820
And the newest Zoan, we’ve met is Stronger,&nbsp;
DocQ’s horse who ate a Pegasus mythical zoan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:47.400
to gain wings. We’re guessing he’d get along&nbsp;
great with Pierre, our other Pegasus in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:53.340
series. Wow - that’s all of the zoans in&nbsp;
the series, but we’re just getting started.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:57.360
**Logia** Up next is the logia&nbsp;
category. These fruits allow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:02.640
users to turn into an element as well as&nbsp;
generate seemingly limitless amounts of it.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.260
1. **Smoke Smoker**
The first logia we met&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:09.360
in the series was Smoker the White Hunter,&nbsp;
a prominent marine and rival to Luffy. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:15.240
devil fruit allows him to turn into smoke. It&nbsp;
was a perfect first opponent to demonstrate the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.580
intangibility of logia fruit users.
2. **Sand Crocodile**&nbsp;

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:22.140
The first Shichibukai the Straw Hats faced&nbsp;
off against was Crocodile, owner of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:27.480
Sand logia. Not only could Crocodile use his&nbsp;
sand to release powerful attacks like Espada,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:32.580
he also had the ability to drain the moisture&nbsp;
out of anything, rendering his opponents into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:37.620
dry husks. However, Luffy found that Crocodile&nbsp;
was weak to water and by drenching his hands,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.500
he could land blows against the Warlord.
3. **Flame Ace**&nbsp;

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:45.480
Luffy’s brother Ace wielded the Flame-Flame&nbsp;
fruit or the Mera Mera no Mi. This fruit was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.480 --> 00:11:49.980
a major plot point in Dressrosa when Doflamingo&nbsp;
offered it as a prize in the Corrida Colosseum&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:56.580
to bait Luffy. In that tournament, Luffy and&nbsp;
Ace’s other brother, Sabo, claimed the fruit.&nbsp;

00:11:56.580 --> 00:12:00.480
4. **Lightning Enel**
Enel has one of the most powerful logia fruits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:05.580
we’ve seen in the series. In addition to the usual&nbsp;
lightning-based powers, we see him striking from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:12.060
an extremely long range, using his electricity&nbsp;
to power technology, manipulate metals, and even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:18.703
restarting his own heart. It’s just unfortunate&nbsp;
for him that a rubber man showed up in Skypiea.&nbsp;

00:12:18.703 --> 00:12:20.400
5. **Ice Aokiji**
Kuzan’s ice fruit is one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:25.920
the few devil fruits we’ve seen that can clearly&nbsp;
impact sea water, despite the sea being a devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:31.560
fruit user’s weakness. By freezing the surface&nbsp;
of the ocean, he’s able to bicycle from island&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:37.860
to island. He can also freeze opponents inside&nbsp;
and out and they can be shattered to pieces if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.020
not carefully thawed out.
6. **Darkness Blackbeard**

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:49.200
Blackbeard has one of the most unusual logias -&nbsp;
the Yami Yami no Mi or the darkness fruit. Rather&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:54.960
than his body turning into darkness, he can suck&nbsp;
matter into a black hole. Blackbeard is also more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.960 --> 00:13:00.461
vulnerable to pain and can nullify the fruit&nbsp;
powers of other devil fruit users he touches.

00:13:00.461 --> 00:13:00.480
1. **Light Kizaru**

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:06.540
Borsalino, another Marine Admiral, use the&nbsp;
pika-pika no mi - the light logia. Using his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:11.640
fruit, he can deliver light speed kicks and fly&nbsp;
from island to island faster than any ship can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:17.689
travel. Dr. Vegapunk also used his fruit as the&nbsp;
basis for developing Pacifista’s beam attacks.

00:13:17.689 --> 00:13:20.460
1. **Magma Akainu**
Sakazuki, the current Fleet Admiral,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:24.900
wields the magma fruit. Its immense power&nbsp;
burns much hotter than the fire fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:28.920
which made it possible for him to&nbsp;
kill Ace during the Marineford War.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:33.840
This is one of the most offensively&nbsp;
powerful fruits in the entire series.&nbsp;

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:38.100
2. **Swamp Caribou**
Caribou is another unique logia user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:43.440
like Blackbeard, whose fruit doesn’t follow the&nbsp;
typical logia rules. His swamp doesn’t seem to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:48.540
be able to generate limitless amounts of muck,&nbsp;
but he does have seemingly limitless storage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:55.320
inside himself. In his swampy pocket dimension&nbsp;
he can store plenty of meat or even mermaids.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:59.220
****Caesar Clown’s Gas-Gas fruit has&nbsp;
dominion over an entire state of matter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:05.040
He’s able to create various gasses, usually&nbsp;
poisonous ones, but he can also remove the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:10.320
oxygen in a given area to suffocate opponents.
****Monet, a member of the Doflamingo family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:15.180
has a snow-snow fruit. This is a fairly&nbsp;
straightforward logia power. After Monet’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:19.260
apparent death, we haven’t seen&nbsp;
a new snow-snow user appear yet.&nbsp;

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:24.000
****One of the Marines’ newest admirals,&nbsp;
Aramaki, showed monstrous strength with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:29.820
his forest logia. He dominated the remnants of&nbsp;
Kaidou’s crew as well as held the Scabbards at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:34.680
bay until interference from Shanks. With his&nbsp;
fruit he can fly long distances on a flower,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:40.440
sap the strength from opponents, and summon a&nbsp;
practical army of plant life to fight for him.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.460
The paramecia category of&nbsp;
devil fruits include…well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:49.800
everything else. This is a mixed bag of powers&nbsp;
that are left up to Oda Sensei’s imagination,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:55.380
but usually fall into two categories. There&nbsp;
are paramecias which manipulate the user’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:55.380 --> 00:15:01.020
body in some way or paramecias that manipulate&nbsp;
the environment or other people in some way.&nbsp;

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:06.660
****Buggy was the first devil fruit user we met&nbsp;
in the series besides Luffy. And now that we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:13.860
know Luffy actually has a mythical zoan, Buggy is&nbsp;
technically the first paramecia user we met. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:18.660
chop-chop fruit allows him to disassemble his&nbsp;
body at will. This makes him immune to cutting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:24.840
attacks. His separated body parts are also&nbsp;
able to fly, provided his feet stay grounded.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:29.760
The sube-sube no mi makes Alvida’s&nbsp;
body smooth and slippery. Attacks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:34.740
simply slide off of this ally of Buggy.
****Mr. 5 of Baroque Works can turn any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:40.620
part of his body into a bomb. He usually uses&nbsp;
boogers, but for an advanced technique he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:45.060
breathe into the chambers of a revolver&nbsp;
for long distance explosive shots.&nbsp;

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:49.680
****Miss Valentine can use her Kilo-Kilo&nbsp;
fruit to alter her own weight up to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:55.440
10,000 kilograms. She can make herself lightweight&nbsp;
to float in the air on her umbrella, or increase&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:59.520
her weight to dive bomb on opponents.
****Nico Robin’s Hana Hana no Mi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:06.720
while being named the flower fruit, doesn’t&nbsp;
have much to do with actual flowers. Instead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:12.120
she “blooms” parts of her body anywhere&nbsp;
she chooses.Pre-Timeskip, she’d usually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:16.500
sprout arms on her opponents and break their&nbsp;
backs with her “clutch” technique. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:21.960
after the time skip she’s demonstrated the ability&nbsp;
to create clones of herself, make giant limbs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:28.020
and even undergo her Demonio transformation.
****Mr. 3, or Galdino, uses the wax-wax fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:32.700
to generate huge quantities of wax.&nbsp;
The most utility this has seen in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:38.820
series is through making keys as well as making&nbsp;
venom-resistant armor for Luffy during Impel Down.

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:44.580
Wapol’s fruit is weird. The munch-munch fruit&nbsp;
allows him to eat anything and then incorporate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:49.560
the material into his own body. He does this&nbsp;
with stone and metals to fortify himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:55.980
and more horrifyingly, eats his own subordinates&nbsp;
to combine them into one super henchman.&nbsp;

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:00.120
****Mr. 2 Bon-Kurei’s Copy ability allows&nbsp;
him to transform his appearance into that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:04.800
of anyone he’s touched with his right&nbsp;
hand, making him a master of deception.&nbsp;

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:11.940
****Daz Bones uses his Dice-Dice fruit to turn&nbsp;
any part of his body into blades. This made a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:17.040
perfect opponent for Zoro who had to learn&nbsp;
how to cut steel in order to defeat Mr. 1.&nbsp;

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.680
****Miss Doublefinger’s&nbsp;
Spike-Spike fruit allows sharp&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:25.260
spikes to protrude from any part of her body.
****Iron-Cage Hina’s epithet is very fitting.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.260 --> 00:17:31.260
Her Ori Ori no Mi, or Bind Bind fruit, lets&nbsp;
her conjure black iron bars to trap criminals.&nbsp;

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:35.760
****Bellamy the Hyena Spring-Spring fruit allows&nbsp;
him to turn his limbs into springs, allowing him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:40.620
to bounce super quickly around a battlefield.
****Doflamingo’s String-String fruit is one of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:45.240
the most versatile devil fruits we’ve seen in&nbsp;
the entire series. Doflamingo is an example of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:50.340
a character who truly mastered his devil fruit&nbsp;
powers. He could use his strings to manipulate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:55.320
people like puppets, to create clones of himself,&nbsp;
to stitch up injuries to his internal organs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:55.320 --> 00:18:02.040
and that’s just the start. That’s not getting&nbsp;
into super OP teachniques like the Bird Cage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:07.440
In addition, the Ito Ito no Mi was the first&nbsp;
example we saw of a Paramecia awakening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.820
allowing him to turn the very environment&nbsp;
around him into strings as well.&nbsp;

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:15.540
****Foxy the Silver Fox’s Noro Noro&nbsp;
no Mi allows him to fire a beam that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:22.020
slows down anything it touches.
****Blueno of CP9 is able to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:27.480
a door in anything and escape to a sort of&nbsp;
pocket dimension. This makes him a great&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:33.840
asset to Cipher Pol as he’s easily able to get&nbsp;
around undetected and flee a scene unnoticed.&nbsp;

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:39.000
****Kalifa, another agent of CP9, was&nbsp;
given a Bubble devil fruit by Spandam,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.200
that among other things, can make&nbsp;
her opponents extra squeaky clean.&nbsp;

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.980
****Captain Very Good’s Berry&nbsp;
fruit lets him turn into balls.&nbsp;

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.700
****Captain Shu’s rust fruit can&nbsp;
cause metallic items to rust.&nbsp;

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:57.660
****And Captain Sharinguru’s Wheels fruit&nbsp;
let’s him turn his arms and legs into wheels.&nbsp;

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:03.660
****Perona’s Hollow-Hollow fruit allows her to&nbsp;
summon ghosts called Negative Hollows, which make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:10.140
anyone they pass through “negative”. She can also&nbsp;
leave her body to float around in spirit form.&nbsp;

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:17.820
****Brook’s Revive fruit brought him back to life&nbsp;
as a skeleton after his death. For a long time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:22.080
that seems its only power, but now he’s&nbsp;
gained the power to manipulate his soul,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:26.340
the souls of others, and summon&nbsp;
ice powers from the depths of hell.&nbsp;

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:34.320
****The former warlord Gecko Moria used his&nbsp;
Shadow-Shadow fruit to separate people’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:39.480
shadows from their bodies and then place&nbsp;
them inside zombies under his control.&nbsp;

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:43.020
****The Clear-Clear fruit first&nbsp;
owned by Absalom and now by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:48.360
Shiryu allows the user to turn invisible.
****Bartholomew Kuma’s Nikyu-Nikyu no Mi or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:54.540
Paw fruit allows him to repel anything, whether&nbsp;
that’s an attack, a person, or even an intangible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:54.540 --> 00:20:00.780
concept like pain. He can use it to transmit&nbsp;
people at high speeds all across the world.&nbsp;

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:08.700
****Eustass Kid has the power of magnetism,&nbsp;
allowing him to manipulate metals. After losing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:13.320
his arm, he uses his fruit to create a metallic&nbsp;
replacement. With his devil fruit awakening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:20.160
he can also make his opponents magnetic.
****Trafalgar Law has the Ope-Ope no Mi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:25.440
which lets him create a “room” in which he&nbsp;
can manipulate just about anything. He can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:30.960
remove people’s body parts, their hearts, swap&nbsp;
their personalities, trade places with objects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:36.180
and attack opponents internally. This fruit&nbsp;
also has a special ability to grant someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:41.280
eternal life at the cost of the user’s&nbsp;
life with the immortality surgery.&nbsp;

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:48.120
****Capone Bege’s Castle fruit turns him into a&nbsp;
Castle Man. He can shrink down his crew who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:54.300
act as an army inside of him, as well as transform&nbsp;
into a full size castle with tank treads.&nbsp;

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:59.280
****Basil Hawkins’ straw-straw fruit lets him&nbsp;
use straw creatures as voodoo dolls connected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:05.400
to other people’s life force, allowing damage&nbsp;
done to himself to be inflicted on other targets.

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:10.140
Scratchman Apoo’s Tone-Tone fruit has&nbsp;
the power to transform his body parts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:16.140
into musical instruments. Anyone who can hear&nbsp;
his music can be harmed by the sound waves.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:22.380
Boa Hancock’s Love-Love fruit allows her to&nbsp;
turn anyone who is attracted to her into stone.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:29.220
The former warden of Impel Down,&nbsp;
Magellan, has the Venom Venom fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:34.680
which is an interesting paramecia. It’s&nbsp;
similar to a logia in that he can conjure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:40.440
seemingly limitless amounts of his toxic&nbsp;
goo, but he can’t turn into it himself. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:44.760
has the terrible side effect, however,&nbsp;
of giving him terrible stomach problems.

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:51.660
Emporio Ivankov’s Hormone devil fruit allows&nbsp;
them to use hormones to all sorts of effects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:57.120
The most common usage of the fruit is change&nbsp;
the sex of themselves or others or giving an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:01.800
adrenaline boost so that the recipient&nbsp;
can overcome fatigue and keep fighting.&nbsp;

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.960
The snip snip fruit allows&nbsp;
Inazuma to transform his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:14.280
arms into scissors that can cut most materials.
The Quake-Quake fruit first owned by Whitebeard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:21.120
and then Blackbeard is said to be a fruit with the&nbsp;
power to destroy the world. It creates powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:26.700
earthquakes, but its power can also be localized&nbsp;
to the user’s fist for an earth-shattering punch.&nbsp;

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:33.180
Jozu earned his nickname with his devil fruit,&nbsp;
which allows him to turn his body into diamond.&nbsp;

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:38.820
A Whitebeard ally who only appeared&nbsp;
briefly, Blamenco, uses a pocket-pocket&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:44.760
fruit to develop pockets on his body.
Vice Admiral Tsuru has one of the weirdest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:50.880
devil fruits of the whole series. Her Woshu-Woshu&nbsp;
no Mi allows her to literally clean evil away from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:56.580
someone. She can wash her opponents “leave them&nbsp;
out to dry” - people affected by her ability fold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:02.880
like clothing and get strung up on a clothesline.
Shiki the Gold Lion may not have appeared in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:02.880 --> 00:23:08.100
One Piece timeline, but he and his&nbsp;
fruit are both canon despite mostly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:08.100 --> 00:23:12.720
being featured in the Strong World film.&nbsp;
His Fuwa Fuwa no Mi allows him to levitate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:20.700
himself as well as any other non-living object.
Vander Decken IX also has a peculiar devil fruit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:27.180
His Mark Mark fruit allows him to mark someone&nbsp;
with his hand. From that point on, any object&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:33.420
he touches or throws with that hand will seek&nbsp;
the target until it hits them or an obstacle.&nbsp;

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:40.200
Kinemon’s Garb Garb fruit allows him to make&nbsp;
clothing. It’s perfect for disguising people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:45.300
however it would be nice if he had people&nbsp;
to disguise who could last more than five&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:45.300 --> 00:23:50.400
minutes without blowing their cover.
Sugar. This Doflamingo family member&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:58.020
has by far one of the most broken fruits in&nbsp;
the entire series. Sugar can turn anyone she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:58.020 --> 00:24:03.000
touches into a living toy with her Hobby Hobby&nbsp;
fruit. Moreover, she can create a contract&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:07.320
with this toy that they are powerless to&nbsp;
disobey. Finally - and here’s where it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:15.120
gets way too OP - everyone immediately forgets&nbsp;
that the person turned into a toy ever existed.&nbsp;

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:21.240
Baby 5, another Doflamingo family member,&nbsp;
can turn any part of her body into any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:21.240 --> 00:24:25.140
weapon she chooses with her Arms Arms&nbsp;
fruit. Presumably because turning them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:25.140 --> 00:24:31.200
into actual arms was already taken by Robin.
Buffalo’s Spin-Spin fruit allows him to spin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:31.200 --> 00:24:37.080
any part of his body like a propeller, which&nbsp;
he uses to fly. We’re just getting started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:43.080
on Donquixote Family devil fruits, too -&nbsp;
His crew has a LOT of devil fruit users.&nbsp;

00:24:43.080 --> 00:24:48.600
Trebol, the grossest character in One Piece,&nbsp;
is such a low quality individual that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:48.600 --> 00:24:54.360
devil fruit name in Japanese is literally the&nbsp;
Beta Beta no Mi.This translates into the Sticky&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:54.360 --> 00:25:00.360
Sticky fruit which produces massive quantities&nbsp;
of sticky mucus. He can use it as projectiles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:00.360 --> 00:25:06.600
and even wears a cloak made out of it to give the&nbsp;
appearance that he’s much larger than he actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:06.600 --> 00:25:14.820
is.The mucus is also extremely flammable.
Admiral Fujitora has a gravity fruit powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:14.820 --> 00:25:20.580
enough to rain down meteors on his opponents.
Bartolomeo can cross his fingers to create&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:20.580 --> 00:25:26.160
powerful barriers, which he can also send&nbsp;
flying for an offensive assault. He can also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:26.160 --> 00:25:29.760
manipulate the shapes of his barriers&nbsp;
to create things such as staircases or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:29.760 --> 00:25:35.940
surround his fists for a bari bari no pistol.
Leo the Tontatta’s Stitch-Stitch fruit allows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:35.940 --> 00:25:39.960
him to sew just about anything.
Viola’s Glare-Glare fruit lets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:39.960 --> 00:25:45.360
her see at amazing distances and even&nbsp;
through walls. Confusingly, she can also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:45.360 --> 00:25:50.520
fire giant projectile whales from her eyes.
Giolla’s Art fruit lets her transform things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:50.520 --> 00:25:56.220
into works of art. Often, her works will resemble&nbsp;
famous art pieces from the real world, such as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:56.220 --> 00:26:02.100
Brook turning intoEdvard Munch’s The Scream.
The jacket jacket fruit is one of the weirdest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:03.480 --> 00:26:07.200
fruits in the series with probably among the&nbsp;
least actual utility. It allows someone to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:07.200 --> 00:26:12.900
wear the user like a jacket, at which&nbsp;
point the user can pilot their body.

00:26:12.900 --> 00:26:19.140
Gladius’s Pop-Pop fruit allows him to expand and&nbsp;
rupture any part of his body in an explosion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:19.140 --> 00:26:24.660
which leaves himself unharmed. He can also&nbsp;
cause inorganic objects he touches to explode&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:24.660 --> 00:26:29.880
as well. His power is extremely similar to the&nbsp;
Bomb-Bomb fruit, with some minor differences.&nbsp;

00:26:29.880 --> 00:26:33.540
Senor Pink, the most hardboiled&nbsp;
member of the Doflamingo family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:33.540 --> 00:26:37.680
uses the Swim-Swim fruit to&nbsp;
swim through matter as if it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:37.680 --> 00:26:42.840
were water. This power is now used&nbsp;
by the Seraphim modeled after Jinbe.&nbsp;

00:26:42.840 --> 00:26:45.840
Speaking of powers similar to&nbsp;
those of Baroque Works members,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:45.840 --> 00:26:51.180
Machvise’s Ton-Ton fruit is extremely similar&nbsp;
to Miss Valentine’s Kilo-Kilo fruit. The only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:51.180 --> 00:26:57.480
difference is…Machvise can increase his weight&nbsp;
far beyond Valentine’s 10,000 kilo limit.

00:26:57.480 --> 00:27:02.580
Another executive of the Donquixote Family,&nbsp;
Diamante uses the Ripple-Ripple fruit to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:02.580 --> 00:27:09.780
make objects or himself ripple like a flag.
Pica uses the Stone-Stone fruit to meld his body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:09.780 --> 00:27:14.760
into any stone structure and manipulate it freely.&nbsp;
Depending on how much stone he has available,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:14.760 --> 00:27:23.100
he can become absolutely massive, hiding his&nbsp;
real body within the stone. During Dressrosa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:23.100 --> 00:27:27.060
he uses this power to dramatically&nbsp;
shift the landscape of the island.&nbsp;

00:27:29.580 --> 00:27:33.420
Kanjuro’s Brush-Brush fruit&nbsp;
allows anything he draws to come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:33.420 --> 00:27:39.740
to life. RIP Ryuunosuke - you were a real one.
Doflamingo’s brother, Rosinante, ate the Nagi Nagi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:39.740 --> 00:27:45.540
no Mi or the Calm-Calm fruit. This allows him to&nbsp;
create a bubble of complete silence where nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:45.540 --> 00:27:50.640
can be heard. This seems like it wouldn’t have&nbsp;
much utility, but as Law’s flashback showed us,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:50.640 --> 00:27:55.020
it can be great for stealth.
The Tontatta Princess&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:55.020 --> 00:28:01.680
Mansherry’s Heal Heal fruit has the power&nbsp;
to instantaneously heal any physical injury.&nbsp;

00:28:02.520 --> 00:28:08.520
Big Mom’s Soul fruit has got to be one of the most&nbsp;
intriguing fruits in the entire series. With it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:08.520 --> 00:28:14.940
she can put part of her soul into any inanimate&nbsp;
object to bring it to life as a “homie.” She can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:16.380 --> 00:28:20.280
also, though, rip the souls from other people.&nbsp;
The citizens of her kingdom willingly give part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:20.280 --> 00:28:25.860
of their life force to her in exchange for&nbsp;
the Yonkou’s protection, but she can also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:25.860 --> 00:28:31.860
take it forcefully from anyone who fears her.
Brulee’s Mirror fruit lets her travel through a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:31.860 --> 00:28:38.640
“mirror” world, a sort of parallel dimension that&nbsp;
connects seemingly every mirror. Other people can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:38.640 --> 00:28:43.440
also travel into the mirror world provided&nbsp;
they’re touching Brulee. She can also use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:43.440 --> 00:28:48.420
her mirror powers to turn into a mirror image&nbsp;
of an opponent as well as to reflect attacks.

00:28:48.420 --> 00:28:53.280
Perospero, Big Mom’s eldest son, uses his&nbsp;
candy fruit to create and manipulate candy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:53.280 --> 00:28:59.880
into any shape he desires. It can be a&nbsp;
gooey and syrupy or it can be hardened.&nbsp;

00:28:59.880 --> 00:29:05.220
Cracker, one of Big Mom’s Sweet Commanders,&nbsp;
uses his Biscuit Fruit to create super hard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:05.220 --> 00:29:10.560
biscuit soldiers. He can control an army&nbsp;
of them as well as wear them as armor.&nbsp;

00:29:10.560 --> 00:29:14.940
Galette’s Butter fruit, you guessed it,&nbsp;
let’s her conjure and manipulate butter.&nbsp;

00:29:14.940 --> 00:29:20.670
Mont d’Or is one of the rare Big Mom crew members&nbsp;
whose power doesn’t involve food. His Baku Baku no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:20.670 --> 00:29:27.180
Mi allows him to control books and this manifests&nbsp;
in a lot of different ways. He can fly by standing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:27.180 --> 00:29:32.940
on floating books, but he can also trap enemies&nbsp;
inside story-based illusions, as well as imprison&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:32.940 --> 00:29:39.900
and preserve people within the pages of his books.
And now we come back to the food. Opera’s fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:39.900 --> 00:29:42.480
is a lot like Galettes, but&nbsp;
with Cream instead of Butter.&nbsp;

00:29:42.480 --> 00:29:46.740
Smoothie, another Sweet Commander, has the&nbsp;
Wring-Wring fruit, which allows her to juice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:46.740 --> 00:29:51.900
just about anything - including giraffes.
Pudding’s Memo-Memo no Mi allows her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:51.900 --> 00:29:56.700
freely manipulate memories. When she uses&nbsp;
her power, people’s memories will appear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:56.700 --> 00:30:02.400
like film reels which she can cut and edit.
Katakuri made the perfect opponent for Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:07.800
during Whole Cake Island because his Mochi fruit&nbsp;
shares a lot of similarities to rubber. Mochi,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:07.800 --> 00:30:12.300
too, is stretchy, but it could do a&nbsp;
whole lot of things that Luffy’s body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:12.300 --> 00:30:18.000
couldn’t since he was able to generate large&nbsp;
quantities of mochi. Unlike other paramecias,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:18.000 --> 00:30:23.580
Katakuri can also change his body into mochi,&nbsp;
making his fruit a “special paramecia”,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:23.580 --> 00:30:29.520
one with the properties of a logia. The key&nbsp;
difference seems to be that Mochi is a man-made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:29.520 --> 00:30:35.520
object rather than an naturally occurring element.
Daifuku’s Hoya Hoya no Mi, or Puff Puff fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:35.520 --> 00:30:40.620
lets him rub his tummy to summon a powerful&nbsp;
halberd wielding genie to fight for him.&nbsp;

00:30:40.620 --> 00:30:45.480
Charlotte Oven uses his Heat-Heat fruit to&nbsp;
heat up his own body. Through touch, he can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:45.480 --> 00:30:51.360
then transfer the heat to opponents or objects.&nbsp;
Oven has one of the few fruits that’s been seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:51.360 --> 00:30:56.160
to directly affect the sea when he boiled&nbsp;
part of the ocean to attack the Sun Pirates.&nbsp;

00:30:56.160 --> 00:31:02.520
Streusen ate the Cook-Cook fruit and is able&nbsp;
to turn any inanimate object into edible food.&nbsp;

00:31:02.520 --> 00:31:06.840
Charlotte Newshi can combine with his nine&nbsp;
decuplet siblings using his Fuse-Fuse fruit.&nbsp;

00:31:09.540 --> 00:31:14.820
Morley of the Revolutionaries uses the Oshi&nbsp;
Oshi no Mi or Push Push fruit to push or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:14.820 --> 00:31:19.920
mold the ground as if it were made of clay.
Belo Betty’s Pump Pump fruit encourages and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:19.920 --> 00:31:26.220
rallies other people to awaken their potential&nbsp;
to fight - a perfect power for a revolutionary.&nbsp;

00:31:27.300 --> 00:31:33.000
O-Tama’s Kibi Kibi no Mi allows her to pull&nbsp;
“dango” from her cheeks. When fed to an animal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:33.000 --> 00:31:38.400
they make the animal completely loyal to&nbsp;
Tama’s command for one month. This power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:38.400 --> 00:31:44.040
also works on Smile fruit users. This power&nbsp;
is largely inspired by the Momotaro myth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:44.040 --> 00:31:48.960
wherein the hero feeds Kibi Dango to&nbsp;
three animals that help him on his quest.&nbsp;

00:31:48.960 --> 00:31:53.520
Kozuki Oden’s wife, Toki, traveled to&nbsp;
the present day from the Void Century&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:53.520 --> 00:32:00.060
using the power of her Time-Time fruit. This&nbsp;
fruit allows her to travel in time, but only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:00.060 --> 00:32:05.220
forward into the future. She can also bring&nbsp;
others along with her on her journey in time.&nbsp;

00:32:05.880 --> 00:32:11.640
Shinobu’s Ripe-Ripe fruit allows her to age&nbsp;
objects or even people such as with Momonosuke.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:11.640 --> 00:32:17.760
However, she is unable to reverse the effects.
Raizo the ninja uses his Scroll-Scroll fruit to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:17.760 --> 00:32:22.620
contain matter or energy within a scroll&nbsp;
and then release it at will. He’s been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:22.620 --> 00:32:26.940
seen to do this with huge amounts of&nbsp;
water and even Kaidou’s blast breath.&nbsp;

00:32:27.480 --> 00:32:30.960
Blackbeard’s crew mates recently&nbsp;
revealed some new devil fruits,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:31.500 --> 00:32:37.200
however not much is known about their full&nbsp;
capabilities at this time. Jesus Burgess’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:37.200 --> 00:32:44.040
Muscle fruit gives him immense physical strength.
Blackbeard’s sniper, Van Auger, can use the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:44.040 --> 00:32:51.240
Warp Warp fruit to teleport himself or objects.
Doc Q uses a Disease fruit to spread illness…or in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:51.240 --> 00:32:58.440
the Heart Pirates’ case to spread mass sex-changes&nbsp;
due to a pun on Malady and M’Lady.140. Brain&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:58.440 --> 00:33:03.240
VegapunkThe most recent devil fruit revealed&nbsp;
as of this writing is Vegapunk’s brain fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:03.240 --> 00:33:08.280
which lets him store an unlimited amount&nbsp;
of knowledge inside of an ever-growing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:13.320
brain. His brain has become so large, in fact,&nbsp;
that he has to house it outside of his head.&nbsp;

00:33:13.320 --> 00:33:16.320
However, we’re still not quite to the end of&nbsp;
our list because there are a handful of powers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:21.960
that we know come from devil fruits but we still&nbsp;
haven’t gotten confirmation of the fruits’ names.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:22.500 --> 00:33:28.620
Jewelry Bonney’s fruit allows her to manipulate&nbsp;
the ages of herself and others. We’re likely to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:28.620 --> 00:33:33.600
get a reveal on her fruit very, very soon.
Another supernova, Urouge, uses an unnamed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:33.600 --> 00:33:38.100
devil fruit to convert physical&nbsp;
damage on himself into raw strength.&nbsp;

00:33:38.100 --> 00:33:46.680
Sanjuan’s Wolf immense size comes from a devil&nbsp;
fruit as well.144. ?&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; LafitteLafitte&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:46.680 --> 00:33:49.980
has an unknown devil fruit that&nbsp;
is likely the source of his wings.&nbsp;

00:33:49.980 --> 00:33:56.040
Karasu the revolutionary also has an unnamed&nbsp;
devil fruit. Unlike a zoan transformation that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:56.040 --> 00:34:01.260
allows him to turn into a giant raven,&nbsp;
he can become an entire flock of ravens.

00:34:02.640 --> 00:34:07.440
And finally, we have Uta. Unlike other&nbsp;
One Piece movie characters like Gild&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:07.440 --> 00:34:12.120
Tesoro or Douglass Bullet, Uta has been&nbsp;
confirmed as a canon character, sort of,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:12.120 --> 00:34:16.440
and that includes her devil fruit,&nbsp;
the Sing-Sing fruit. Using her voice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:16.440 --> 00:34:22.320
Uta can lull people asleep and bring them into&nbsp;
an illusory world that’s under her control.

00:34:24.360 --> 00:34:29.340
There you have it - All 146 devil fruits&nbsp;
featured in One Piece so far! But if you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:29.340 --> 00:34:33.660
want to know which devil fruits are&nbsp;
the BEST you can check out this video.

